<<SetExpression surprise surprise>>
Molly: What the heck is that thing??
Molly: Is it dead?
<<SetExpression surprise frown>>
Molly: Ummm… I think it just moved.
<<SetExpression surprise frown>>
<<SetSpeakerName King's-Ghost>>
King's Ghost: It is an unfamiliar, to be certain. We must face it head on.
<<SetExpression idle annoyed>>
<<SetSpeakerName Molly>>
Molly: Do I really have to fight this thing?
<<SetSpeakerName King's-Ghost>>
King's Ghost: Unfortunately, you must. Be brave, child.
<<SetExpression idle annoyed>>
<<SetSpeakerName Molly>>
Molly: And how exactly do I fight it?
<<SetSpeakerName King's-Ghost>>
King's Ghost: Unfamiliars may only be defeated by the appropriate familiar.
<<SetExpression surprise frown>>
<<SetSpeakerName Molly>>
Molly: But all I have is this frog!
<<SetSpeakerName King's-Ghost>>
King's Ghost: Then let us hope it is the familiar we need.
<<SetExpression surprise annoyed>>
<<SetSpeakerName Molly>>
Molly: I don't know about this...

